**Lyasoff (2016), p. 1071, integral lines of V = (σ²x/2)∂ₓ + σ∂ᵧ**

the flow is u ↦ (x e^{σ²u/2}, y + σ u).
   PAPER NOTE: printed second coordinate (y+u)σ is wrong; flow of σ∂ᵧ is y+σu.


**Lyasoff (2016), p. 1071**

that curve is an integral curve of the vector field V.


**Lyasoff (2016), p. 1073, foliation**

every point (x,y) in ℝ₊₊×ℝ lies on the line through (x e^{-σy/2}, 0).
